WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:02.852
You built something good.

2
00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:06.487
Now it has to reach the people it’s for.

3
00:00:09.998 --> 00:00:11.058
Meet Traction.

4
00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:13.365
A growth partner for your app.

5
00:00:13.831 --> 00:00:15.351
It shows where you stand,

6
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:17.429
And what it takes to reach the next stage.

7
00:00:18.653 --> 00:00:21.033
No forms. Just tell it what happened.

8
00:00:22.786 --> 00:00:24.266
It fills in the board for you.

9
00:00:24.853 --> 00:00:28.193
It researches each prospect, and shows who to reach first.

10
00:00:28.986 --> 00:00:31.706
Then it drafts the first email, in your voice.

11
00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:33.142
You decide what gets sent.

12
00:00:33.808 --> 00:00:36.908
Every move sits on one timeline, beside your numbers,

13
00:00:37.253 --> 00:00:39.813
so you can see what brings people in.

14
00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.270
We set it up with you, and work on it together.

15
00:00:51.719 --> 00:00:53.219
Let’s find your next users.
